    "Description": "Mozilla Thunderbird is a standalone mail and newsgroup client.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Sandbox escape due to incorrect boundary conditions in the Graphics component (CVE-2026-92035)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the Graphics: Canvas2D component (CVE-2026-100832)\n\n* firefox: Use-after-free in the Layout: Text and Fonts component (CVE-2026-100784)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Privilege escalation in the DLL Services component (CVE-2026-100801)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Sandbox escape due to incorrect boundary conditions in the Internationalization component (CVE-2026-100794)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Privilege escalation in the Address Bar component (CVE-2026-100820)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the Graphics: Canvas2D component (CVE-2026-100777)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Information disclosure in the Networking: JAR component (CVE-2026-100766)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the XSLT component (CVE-2026-100779)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Privilege escalation in the DOM: Service Workers component (CVE-2026-100807)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: JIT miscompilation in the JavaScript: WebAssembly component (CVE-2026-100792)\n\n* firefox: Privilege escalation due to use-after-free in the Graphics: WebRender component (CVE-2026-100797)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Sandbox escape due to incorrect boundary conditions in the XPCOM component (CVE-2026-100819)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the JavaScript: WebAssembly component (CVE-2026-100776)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the Widget component (CVE-2026-100757)\n\n* firefox: Sandbox escape due to use-after-free in the Graphics component (CVE-2026-100786)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Information disclosure in the Networking component (CVE-2026-96869)\n\n* firefox: Sandbox escape due to use-after-free in the DOM: Content Processes component (CVE-2026-100770)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the JavaScript: WebAssembly component (CVE-2026-100769)\n\n* firefox: Use-after-free in the DOM: Core \u0026 HTML component (CVE-2026-100791)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Sandbox escape due to use-after-free in the Widget: Gtk component (CVE-2026-100818)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Privilege escalation due to incorrect boundary conditions in the Graphics component (CVE-2026-100782)\n\n* firefox: firefox: Sandbox escape via use-after-free in DOM component (CVE-2026-100811)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the DOM: Core \u0026 HTML component (CVE-2026-100772)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Uninitialized memory in the Storage: Quota Manager component (CVE-2026-100759)\n\n* firefox: Sandbox escape due to use-after-free in the DOM: Core \u0026 HTML component (CVE-2026-100778)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Sandbox escape in the DOM: Navigation component (CVE-2026-100758)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Sandbox escape in the Graphics component (CVE-2026-100775)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Sandbox escape due to incorrect boundary conditions in the Graphics: WebRender component (CVE-2026-100781)\n\n* firefox: Use-after-free in the DOM: Core \u0026 HTML component (CVE-2026-100774)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Same-origin policy bypass in the WebExtensions component (CVE-2026-100803)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the Graphics: Canvas2D component (CVE-2026-100789)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the DOM: Core \u0026 HTML component (CVE-2026-100785)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Site isolation issue in the Panning and Zooming component (CVE-2026-100821)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Invalid pointer in the JavaScript: WebAssembly component (CVE-2026-100788)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Undefined behavior in the DOM: Streams component (CVE-2026-100771)\n\n* firefox: Sandbox escape due to use-after-free in the DOM: Content Processes component (CVE-2026-100762)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the XSLT component (CVE-2026-100790)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the Storage: IndexedDB component (CVE-2026-100773)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the DOM: Core \u0026 HTML component (CVE-2026-100780)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the Networking: Cache component (CVE-2026-100767)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Incorrect boundary conditions in the Audio/Video: Playback component (CVE-2026-100756)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Uninitialized memory in the Audio/Video component (CVE-2026-100783)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
